[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5464.109, "timestamp": "01:31:04", "text": "8833 的意思是 30，對嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5470.189, "timestamp": "01:31:10", "text": "稍等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5471.03, "timestamp": "01:31:11", "text": "啊，我也這麼認為。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5473.95, "timestamp": "01:31:13", "text": "馬鈴薯在那邊，所以它們可能也在那邊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5478.79, "timestamp": "01:31:18", "text": "那麼接下來會發生什麼事呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5480.99, "timestamp": "01:31:20", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5485.229, "timestamp": "01:31:25", "text": "哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5487.07, "timestamp": "01:31:27", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5494.27, "timestamp": "01:31:34", "text": "好了，睡覺吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5494.35, "timestamp": "01:31:34", "text": "2"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5510.47, "timestamp": "01:31:50", "text": "想去一次嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5512.87, "timestamp": "01:31:52", "text": "是的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5515.669, "timestamp": "01:31:55", "text": "難道我還要說這件事已經結束了嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5518.109, "timestamp": "01:31:58", "text": "啊，是的。一定。所以，如果你不回來…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5518.229, "timestamp": "01:31:58", "text": "2"}]